# Files written while the app runs; without this, `tauri dev` restarts the app and open sessions are lost.
# dotnet build of the WPF preview (Tests panel, XAML preview)
xaml-preview/bin/
xaml-preview/obj/
# claude writes type stubs into every mod folder it loads; in debug the built-in mod is the source folder.
# The whole folder: creating types/ reports a change of .claude-plugin itself (seen on Windows).
**/.claude-plugin
